{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44248","headline":"和友人次韵 · 鱼玄机","name":"和友人次韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"何事能销旅馆愁，红牋开处见银钩。\n蓬山雨洒千峰小，嶰谷风吹万叶秋。\n字字朝看轻碧玉，篇篇夜诵在衾裯。\n欲将香匣收藏却，且惜时吟在手头。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鱼玄机","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44248.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44248","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}